<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Aug unemployment falls yr/yr to 14.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian Aug unemployment falls yr/yr to 14.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Employment Office released the following unemployment data.</p>
<p>    BELGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	   Aug 96     Jul 96     Aug 95</p>
<p>    Total registered jobless     620,081    598,866    630,859</p>
<p>    Pct of workforce		 14.5	 14.0	 14.9</p>
<p>NOTE - all registered unemployed, whether or not they receive unemployment benefits</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
